  "content": "<p>此模组为所有森林生物群落添加了许多不同的遗迹。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1197/133/ruin4.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1197/130/ruin1.png\" width=\"385\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1197/132/ruin3.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1197/134/ruin5.png\" width=\"385\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong>隐藏宝藏</strong>：部分遗迹中藏有秘密宝箱</li>\n</ul><hr><p>欢迎在您的整合包中自由使用此模组</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>另请查看沙漠遗迹模组：</strong></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1312/228/big-ruin.png\" width=\"385\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/desert-ruins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/desert-ruins</a></span></p>",
